## 4. Nilpotent row `g10_3` is essential — PASS

Omitting `g10_3` from (3) leaves

```text
32768*g12_6 - 35*k*rs^4 + 4096*rs*g10_2
  = -8192*cs*g10_3
  = -1536*cs*c0*c1.
